  "_comment": "Copy to agents.json. The ONLY place agent names live. Every unit file, tmux session, ttyd route, AMQ inbox and portal pane is generated from this list. orchestrator = the Unix user the orchestrator daemon runs as: a dedicated system account, not one of the agents.",
